{v_1 : tensor} |= (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0) ∨ min(v_1) ≥ 0

Rule 20 (input tensor must be 1-dimensional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 1

Rule 32 (Integer indices only valid with int-compatible dtype)
